    "text": "A white precipitate was formed when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BaCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> was&nbsp;added to water extract of an inorganic salt. Further,&nbsp;a gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;with characteristic odour was released&nbsp;when the formed white precipitate was dissolved in&nbsp;dilute HCI. The anion present in the inorganic salt is:",
