  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dc0f34a4-fb3e-418a-bc95-48fb8c2b8bc6-image.png\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 70px;\" /></p><p>A white precipitate was formed when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BaCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;when added to water extract of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp;salt. which is an&nbsp;inorganic salt.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>white</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pracipitate</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>BaSO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is formed.&nbsp;Further,&nbsp;a gas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;with burning sulphur like&nbsp;odour will be released&nbsp;when the<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BaSO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp; dissolved in&nbsp;dilute HCI.</p>",
